      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "If you want to marry me, wait a little."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "If you don't study hard, you will never speak English fluently."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Unless you work harder, you will never pass the examination."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "She has been working in a bank since she left school."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Since she is ill, I can't take her with me."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You may watch TV after you finish your homework."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Though I love you, I can not do this."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Though he is young, he is very wise."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "As you weren't there, I left a message."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I watched her as she combed her hair."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "As he grew older, he lost interest in everything."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "As before, he studied hard."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "She likes music as much as I do."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Do as I say."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Leave the table as it is."
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Young as I am, I know it."
        }
      ]
    },
